# Browser verification — provider rejection visibility (Fix 4)

Date: 2026-10-22. App: http://localhost:3000 (dev, local Supabase + Midtrans
sandbox). Account: ryan@gmail.com (test-only).

Order: b8a50434-a2b8-42d9-b604-14e048b7a6b6 — batch 80480336-3607-4489-9209-84cf0efc907d
(Kangkung, 10 ikat, Tier 2, Rp 800, payment window open until 22 Okt 2026 18.07 WIB).

## Real charge attempt (unmocked)

POST /api/umkm/orders/b8a50434-.../payment/charge → 201 Created (Snap session created)
POST /api/umkm/orders/b8a50434-.../payment/reconcile → 502 PAYMENT_PROVIDER_MISMATCH

The sandbox accepted the Rp 800 transaction this time, so the provider-rejection
branch could not be produced by a live charge. The reconcile mismatch
("Hasil pemeriksaan tidak sesuai tagihan. Hubungi bantuan transaksi.") is the
pre-existing sandbox amount behaviour and is outside the four fixes.

## Terminal rejection state (responses intercepted with the exact route body)

Intercepted POST .../payment/charge and POST .../payment/reconcile with:

HTTP 502
{
  "error": "Pembayaran ditolak provider pembayaran.",
  "code": "PAYMENT_PROVIDER_REJECTED",
  "details": {
    "providerMessage": "Transaction amount is not equal to the expected total.",
    "errorMessages": ["Transaction amount is not equal to the expected total."],
    "providerRequestId": "req-abc-123"
  },
  "requestId": "2BCB8D5A-A333-482D-92F2-705A8699EFF5"
}

Rendered alert after clicking the pay button:

Pembayaran ditolak provider pembayaran. Alasan provider: Transaction amount is not
equal to the expected total.
Kode rujukan: 2BCB8D5A-A333-482D-92F2-705A8699EFF5
Percobaan baru dengan data yang sama akan ditolak provider. Hubungi bantuan dengan
kode rujukan di atas bila pesanan perlu diperiksa.

Buttons in the payment panel after the rejection: "Cek status pembayaran" only.
No "Coba lagi", no "Lanjutkan pembayaran"/"Coba bayar lagi"/"Bayar sekarang", and
no "Buka checkout langsung" fallback (canOpen is false for a terminal rejection).

